agm-0981: AGM H6 Wi-Fi step 1 (bsd/dev/agm_wcn.c): boot-arg agm_wcn=1 powers the integrated
Marlin3 WCN (SC2730 LDOs, Merlion GPIOs, PMU), loads /usr/lib/agm-wcnmodem.bin (Android's
/odm/firmware/wcnmodem.bin, dropped into the root) to DDR 0x87000000, starts the CP and waits for
its ready word. agm_keys.c exports agm_pmic_rd/wr and agm_gpio_out.

